OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 27 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Saint-Saens
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how
OL,6,     GCamille Saint-Saens's musical
OL,7,     Ginterests took hold in childhood,
OL,8,     Gshaped by whistling kettles,
OL,9,     Gbrassy orchestras, and at his
OL,10,     Gbeloved piano.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes members
OL,13,     Gor the Chineke! Chamber Ensemble
OL,14,     Gfor a live performance, and talks
OL,15,     Gto conductor Robert Ames about
OL,16,     Ghis upcoming projects.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
